acing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"If a tree falls in a forest and no one is around to hear it, does it make a sound?\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>The Admin Axe</b> is an admin tool obtainable only by using a Spawn Menu. Like the name implies, it's a tool used for ease of testing for tree cutting. It has maxed out stats, capable of one-shotting most trees in the game, having no charge and 50 studs of range.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>The Admin Axe</b> is a medium sized hatchet with a glossy pink headpiece and pearly white handle. Headpiece is pink in color with the default legacy foil material applied to it. Handle is colored white, using the default legacy wood material.\n</p><p>It's model appears to derived from the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Axe\" title=\"Rusty Axe\">Rusty Axe</a>, minus the improvised grip.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9231a6f8d8a1540de7ffa6abe0c9b9c2\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Admin_Axe_GC-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:121px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Admin_Axe_GC.png\" title=\"Admin Axe GC.png (21 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:121px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Admin_Axe_GC.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/122?cb=20230719150141\" title=\"Admin Axe GC.png (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"145\" data-image-name=\"Admin Axe GC.png\" data-image-key=\"Admin_Axe_GC.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Admin Axe GC.png (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"145\" data-image-name=\"Admin Axe GC.png\" data-image-key=\"Admin_Axe_GC.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Admin_Axe_GC.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/122?cb=20230719150141\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"AdminAxe3rdTexture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:91px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:AdminAxe3rdTexture.png\" title=\"AdminAxe3rdTexture.png (67 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:91px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/87/AdminAxe3rdTexture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/91?cb=20230719145540\" title=\"AdminAxe3rdTexture.png (67 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"AdminAxe3rdTexture.png\" data-image-key=\"AdminAxe3rdTexture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"AdminAxe3rdTexture.png (67 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"AdminAxe3rdTexture.png\" data-image-key=\"AdminAxe3rdTexture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/87/AdminAxe3rdTexture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/91?cb=20230719145540\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Early version of <b>Admin Axe</b> used to have a decal of the internet meme \"Giga Chad\" plastered over it's headpiece. DevShurikeno used to have a special variant of the Admin Axe, with a decal of...Twitch streamer XQC morphed into a Pepe the frog holding a pink heart plastered over it's headpiece.</li>\n<li>Current design of <b>Admin Axe</b> seems to be heavily based upon the Alpha Axe of Testing from Lumber Tycoon 2.</li>\n<li>Current design of <b>Admin Axe</b> uses the design first introduced in older Oaklands iteration - Oaklands Legacy.</li>\n<li>\"<b>If a tree falls in a forest and no one is around to hear it, does it make a sound?</b>\" is a philosophical thought experiment that raises questions regarding observation and perception.</li>\n<li>The admin axe was obtainable in the testing version of Oaklands</li>\n<li>The admin axe as well as other admin tools are publicly usable in \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/14171339725/Oaklands-100-Players\">Oaklands 100 Players</a>\", however this game is rarely unlocked by the developers.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903162957\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 95/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 502/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 85/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐ex